WEBVTT

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:31.816
I was devastated
because my favorite mobile game,

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:33.056
Flappy Bird,

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:34.736
was being taken off the app store.

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:36.816
(Laughter)

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:38.376
So I was faced with the dilemma

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:42.296
to either never update my phone
or never play Flappy Bird again.

00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:44.200
(Laughter)

00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:47.256
Unhappy with both options,

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:49.816
I did the only thing
that made sense to me.

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:52.016
I made a physical version of Flappy Bird

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:54.136
that could never be
taken off the app store.

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:55.840
(Laughter)

00:00:57.120 --> 00:00:59.600
(Music)